    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n# \n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/69de42156623bb0c57f1ecf6/Jg6kihL6lKXsg6GMg53p0.jpeg) ⟨28⟩\narinbalyan⟨28⟩\n/\nagroaid-models⟨29⟩\nlike 0\n PyTorch ⟨30⟩\nLicense: mit\n Model card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨31⟩ Community ⟨32⟩\nCopy to bucket new\n  * AgroAid Models⟨33⟩\n    * Crop Disease Classifier⟨34⟩\n    * Crop Yield Predictor⟨35⟩\n    * Crop Recommendation⟨36⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨33⟩ AgroAid Models \nTrained models for the AgroAid smart farming application:\n##   ⟨34⟩ Crop Disease Classifier \n  * Model: ResNet-18\n  * Dataset: PlantVillage (54 classes, 87K images)\n  * Training notebook: arinbalyan/agroaid-crop-disease-classification\n  * Status: Training on Kaggle\n\n\n##   ⟨35⟩ Crop Yield Predictor \n  * Model: LightGBM / Random Forest\n  * Dataset: FAO Crop Yield (Kaggle)\n  * Training notebook: arinbalyan/agroaid-crop-yield-prediction\n  * Status: Training on Kaggle\n\n\n##   ⟨36⟩ Crop Recommendation \n  * Model: XGBoost\n  * Dataset: Kaggle Crop Recommendation\n  * Training notebook: arinbalyan/agroaid-crop-recommendation\n  * Status: Training on Kaggle\n\n\nModels will be uploaded after Kaggle training completes. Downloads last month\n    \n-     \nDownloads are not tracked for this model. How to track ⟨37⟩\nInference Providers NEW⟨38⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨39⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨40⟩ Privacy⟨41⟩ About⟨42⟩ Careers⟨43⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nInference providers allow you to run inference using different serverless providers.\n",
